- The base `\gls{cpf1}` model (`\gls{cpf1}`).
- The `\gls{cpf1}` model incorporating the `\gls{dsf}` approach as defined in `\cref{sec:arch_cpf2}` (+`\gls{dsf}`).
- The complete `\gls{cpf2}` model, which includes random assignment of $\alpha$ (`\gls{cpf2}`).
..................................................
\begin{itemize}
